eria that fight the spec or the code.\\nFor each, give your recommended ruling in a few words. End with STATUS line.\\n\\nContext: #7 (the tr [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":4,"content":"{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\" preflight review of\",\"session_id\":\"a4b49908-1fff-436c-8b85-7053cc35540a\",\"timestamp_ms\":1790844177176}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-11.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":2,"content":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Read-only doc preflight. Do not edit anything. Do not delegate further.\\n\\nRead GitHub issue #11 (`gh issue view 11`) and spec #4 (`gh issue view 4`, plus its comments for the probe findings), then the existing code it builds on: src/status_record.rs, src/runner.rs, src/job_registry.rs, src/stream.rs, src/finalize.rs, src/prompt.rs, src/models.rs, src/capability.rs, tests/e2e.rs, Cargo.toml.\\n\\nList, max 250 words total, one line each:\\n1. Contradictions between #11, #4 and the existing code.\\n2. Defaults or formats nothing states but the lane must pick (job id format, status-record path and JSON shape, heartbeat interval, watch output format, watch exit code on timeout, where the binary target lives).\\n3. Failure cases with no stated behaviour or error output.\\n4. Acceptance criteria that fight the spec or the code.\\nFor each, give your recommended ruling in a few words. End with STATUS line.\\n\\nContext: #7 (the [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":4,"content":"{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\" preflight analysis \",\"session_id\":\"a592e948-93da-4c3d-a67c-1f8d125d3b0d\",\"timestamp_ms\":1790844175667}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":142,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_i