{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"tool_4f5d8725-4a25-4019-8220-03415e35363","tool_call":{"grepToolCall":{"args":{"pattern":"issue.*15|#15|lane-15","path":"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures","caseInsensitive":false,"multiline":false,"toolCallId":"tool_4f5d8725-4a25-4019-8220-03415e35363","offset":0},"result":{"success":{"pattern":"issue.*15|#15|lane-15","path":"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures","outputMode":"content","workspaceResults":{"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures":{"content":{"matches":[{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-15.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":2,"content":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Read-only doc preflight. Do not edit anything. Do not delegate further.\\n\\nRead GitHub issue #15 (`gh issue view 12`), spec #4 (`gh issue view 4` and its comments), and the owner rulings already posted on #7, #9, #10, #11, #12, #13 (`gh issue view N --comments`). Assume #7–#13 land as ruled. Then read the code on origin/main that #15 touches (src/cli.rs, tests/cli_e2e.rs, and whatever the ticket names).\\n\\nList, max 250 words total, one line each:\\n1. Contradictions between #15, #4, the rulings and the code.\\n2. Defaults or formats #15 leaves unstated that the lane must pick.\\n3. Failure cases with no stated behaviour.\\n4. Acceptance criteria that fight the spec or the code.\\nFor each give your recommended ruling in a few words, preferring the smallest change. End with a STATUS line.\\n\\nAlso read the #6 probe findings comment on #4 and the recorded fixtures under tests/fixtures/ (pi/, claude/, cursor/) on origin/ [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":8,"content":"{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\"issue #15. I will read\",\"session_id\":\"7dd612d0-6469-4d8d-870b-f50c14f3831a\",\"timestamp_ms\":1790845569238}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":14,"content":"{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\"#15, spec #4, the owner\",\"session_id\":\"7dd612d0-6469-4d8d-870b-f50c14f3831a\",\"timestamp_ms\":1790845569239}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":19,"content":"{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\" that #15 touches.\",\"session_id\":\"7dd612d0-6469-4d8d-870b-f50c14f3831a\",\"timestamp_ms\":1790845569239}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":22,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"started\",\"call_id\":\"tool_f4f491ce-bd7b-44f1-93c1-bf7941cf22a\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures && gh issue view 15 --comments 2>/dev/null; echo \\\"---\\\"; gh issue view 4 --comments 2>/dev/null\",\"workingDirectory\":\"\",\"timeout\":30000,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_f4f491ce-bd7b-44f1-93c1-bf7941cf22a\",\"simpleCommands\":[\"cd\",\"gh\",\"echo\",\"gh\"],\"hasInputRedirect\":false,\"hasOutputRedirect\":true,\"parsingResult\":{\"parsingFailed\":false,\"executableCommands\":[{\"name\":\"cd\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"}],\"fullText\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"issue\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"view\"},{\"type\":\"number\",\"value\":\"15\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"--comments\"}],\"fullText\":\"gh issue view 15 --comments\"},{\"name\":\"echo\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\\\"---\\\"\"}],\"fullText\":\"echo \\\"---\\\"\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"v [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":25,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"started\",\"call_id\":\"tool_f4f3840b-9e43-416d-b2c2-1d69e3f2c3a\",\"tool_call\":{\"grepToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"pattern\":\"#15|issue 15|preflight\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\",\"glob\":\"*\",\"caseInsensitive\":fa