his repo. Use `gh`; it infers the repo from the clone.\\n\\n- **Publish** (a spec, a ticket): `gh issue create`, multi-line body from a heredoc or `--body-file`.\\n- **Fetch a ticket**: `gh issue view <n> --comments`.\\n- **Labels**: the triage vocabulary is in `triage-labels.md`.\\n- **Triage covers issues only.** Pull requests here are the owner's own work and never enter the triage queue.\\n\\n## Wayfinding\\n\\n`/wayfinder` keeps a **map**: one issue labelled `wayfinder:map` holding Notes, Decisions so far, and Fog. Its tickets are child issues.\\n\\n- **Child ticket**: a GitHub sub-issue of the map, labelled `wayfinder:<research|prototype|grilling|task>`. Without sub-issues, list th [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-17.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":29,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_69b5b09a-33a2-4d8c-9775-ce53a1d0a32\",\"tool_call\":{\"grepToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"pattern\":\"#17|issue 17\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\",\"caseInsensitive\":false,\"multiline\":false,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_69b5b09a-33a2-4d8c-9775-ce53a1d0a32\",\"offset\":0},\"result\":{\"success\":{\"pattern\":\"#17|issue 17\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\",\"outputMode\":\"content\",\"workspaceResults\":{\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\":{\"content\":{\"matches\":[{\"file\":\"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-17.stdout\",\"matches\":[{\"lineNumber\":2,\"content\":\"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"message\\\":{\\\"role\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Read-only doc preflight. Do not edit anything. Do not delegate further.\\\\n\\\\nRead GitHub issue #17 (`gh issue view 12`), spec #4 (`gh issue view 4` and its comments), and the owner rulings already posted on #7, #9, #10, #11, #12, #13 (`gh issue view N --comments`). Assume #7–#13 land as ru [... omitted end of long line]","co