 JobStatus::Running)\\n622-        });\\n623-        poll_locked(&st, job_id)\\n624-    }\\n625-\\n626:    pub fn wait_any(\\n627-        &self,\\n628-        ids: &[String],\\n629-        timeout_ms: Option<f64>,\\n630-        o: WaitOpts<'_>,\\n631-    ) -> WaitAnyResult {\\n632-        let timeout = ms(clamp_wait(timeout_ms.unwrap_or(DEFAULT_WAIT_TIMEOUT)));\\n633-        // Earliest to retire, not first in `ids`: two jobs can finish before the waiter wakes.\\n634-        [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-9.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":18,"content":"{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Gathering issues #9, #4, and #7 (with comments) and reading the referenced source files.\\n\\n\\n\"}]},\"session_id\":\"a4b49908-1fff-436c-8b85-7053cc35540a\",\"model_call_id\":\"a09b1b3c-34aa-45b4-baad-9b84151ab3b9-0-t3cc\",\"timestamp_ms\":1790844178597}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":19,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"started\",\"call_id\":\"tool_2a62a29c-785c-46f5-8578-c6e93fa186b\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures && gh issue view 9 && gh issue view 4 && gh issue view 4 --comments && gh issue view 7 --comments\",\"workingDirectory\":\"\",\"timeout\":30000,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_2a62a29c-785c-46f5-8578-c6e93fa186b\",\"simpleCommands\":[\"cd\",\"gh\",\"gh\",\"gh\",\"gh\"],\"hasInputRedirect\":false,\"hasOutputRedirect\":false,\"parsingResult\":{\"parsingFailed\":false,\"executableCommands\":[{\"name\":\"cd\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"}],\"fullText\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"issue\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"view\"},{\"type\":\"number\",\"value\":\"9\"}],\"fullText\":\"gh issue view