]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":175,"content":"{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\"non-zero per issue #7.\",\"session_id\":\"a4b49908-1fff-436c-8b85-7053cc35540a\",\"timestamp_ms\":1790844203715}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":180,"content":"{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\" by issue #7. Multiple\",\"session_id\":\"a4b49908-1fff-436c-8b85-7053cc35540a\",\"timestamp_ms\":1790844203715}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":476,"content":"{\"type\":\"result\",\"subtype\":\"success\",\"duration_ms\":70188,\"duration_api_ms\":70188,\"is_error\":false,\"result\":\"Gathering issues #9, #4, and #7 (with comments) and reading the referenced source files.\\n\\n\\n**1. Contradictions**\\n- #9/#4 require a per-`cwd` cross-process lock; `job_registry` only has in-process `path_lock`. → **Supervisor holds `flock`; MCP unchanged until #13.**\\n- Spec stories 12–13 vs #7 “MCP `job_registry` untouched”: CLI lock won’t block MCP `cursor_run`. → **File lock is authoritative for `cwd`; document dual-interface gap until #13.**\\n- #7: read-write → `--sandbox disabled`; `capability.rs` `Write` stays sandboxed. → **CLI maps read-write to unsandboxed path only.**\\n- `status_record.rs` uses `cursor-delegate-jobs`; #7 rules `delegate-jobs`. → **Supervisor uses #7 path.**\\n- #7 adds `supervisorPid` / `heartbeatAt` / `resume` on records; `PollResult` lacks them. → **Extend serialized record per #7.**\\n\\n**2. #9 unstated defaults**\\n- Lock file location and payload. → [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-11.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":40,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_b6caf474-b064-49a5-80f6-0688f43e723\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures && gh issue view 11